From 8127eb63c9dc3322b204ec0b84e13aca1ae545cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:08:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vr: holographic hand reticles, also over the stereo 3D scenes

Each controller shows a clear holographic reticle across its aim (glassy
disc, bright rim, counter-rotating dashed ring and ticks, centre pip) with
its beam. In stereo 3D scenes (battles, the ship map) the hands were not
drawn at all; they now appear over each eye's frame, rendered from the pose
the frame is submitted with, with a short guide beam that fades out. The
desktop preview's hand is held in view.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
